Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.65,0:02:15.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah can't see!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.12,0:02:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His retinas were\Ndamaged in that last attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.06,0:02:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's blind!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.09,0:02:21.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.84,0:02:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.65,0:02:24.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't see anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.02,0:02:29.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NIt started running like crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.75,0:02:30.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NDon't just stand there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.72,0:02:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop that thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.69,0:02:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NWe can't let it go any further!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.10,0:02:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire the trench mortars!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NGomorrah, don't do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.69,0:02:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI]\NYou're in no shape to go on!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.13,0:02:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll kill yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.10,0:02:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe said that he made\Na promise to Sodom.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.24,0:02:55.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He told Sodom "Leave the rest to me!"
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.04,0:02:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"I'll take on your share and carry\Neveryone the rest of the way!"
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.35,0:03:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.93,0:03:08.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NThey were in its stomach?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.14,0:03:11.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm full already...couldn't\Neat another bite.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.44,0:03:14.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's take 'em with us as back-up food.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.51,0:03:18.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro! Come here, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.08,0:03:21.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Some pirates gave Sodom and\NGomorrah a serious beating!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You pirates have got a lotta nerve!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Never touch my family!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.82,0:03:35.29,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still injured!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.53,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time for a dance party!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.38,0:03:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.08,0:03:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWe're headed straight for a dead end!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll crash into it and die!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NGomorrah! Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.46,0:03:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll never make it! Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NA dead end?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.73,0:03:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't see one.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.70,0:03:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.43,0:03:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.73,0:03:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NCan't say I see anything of the sort.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.44,0:04:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Courthouse!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.58,0:04:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MEN]\NHe did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.08,0:04:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You made it, Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.66,0:04:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NAll units!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.49,0:04:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The King Bull carrying the\Npirates broke through Block D
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and they are now at\Nthe Courthouse Plaza!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.03,0:04:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.73,0:04:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The King Bull carrying\Nthe pirates broke through...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.17,0:05:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NLook at this, Funkfreed.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.88,0:05:09.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NA Golden Transponder Snail.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Having this little gadget is the same
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.35,0:05:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as having the authority\Nto issue a Buster Call.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means I have the\Nsame power as a Navy admiral,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.66,0:05:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or someone even higher up than that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.93,0:05:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Admiral Aokiji entrusted it to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.27,0:05:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The question is\N"if and when will I use it"?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.81,0:05:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.01,0:05:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once I revive the ancient weapons,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.01,0:05:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this won't just be something\Nthat's "on loan" to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.98,0:05:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll carry it of my own accord,\Nalong with the power to control an army.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.17,0:05:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NWith the single push of a button,\Nan entire island will disappear!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.21,0:05:53.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Authority can be a weapon unto itself.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.18,0:05:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, the power.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.65,0:05:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NChief Spandam!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.22,0:05:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NThat was close!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.65,0:06:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.02,0:06:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you even knock?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.08,0:06:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I almost accidentally hit the button!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.85,0:06:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid we've\Ngot an emergency here!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.45,0:06:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's an urgent call from\NEnies Lobby's Main Island!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.09,0:06:17.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's an emergency, why didn't\Nthey just call my room directly?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.57,0:06:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.53,0:06:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.37,0:06:20.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is the receiver off the hook?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.57,0:06:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This always happens!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's responsible?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.04,0:06:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, you were saying\Nsomething about an emergency, weren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NYes sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.40,0:06:39.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spanda.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.39,0:06:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NHey! Ms. Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.30,0:06:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems we have an\Nurgent report coming in
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.40,0:06:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the marines\Ndown at the Main Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.90,0:06:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Knowing what it's likely about,\NI wouldn't call it an "emergency," exactly.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.24,0:07:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friends tried their best but only\Nmanaged to take down five of our soldiers.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.85,0:07:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder how they\Nwere ultimately defeated.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did some of my other\Nmen bring them down,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.55,0:07:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or was it the giant gatekeeping\Nteam of Oimo and Kashii?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.46,0:07:14.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So many possibilities.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't we listen to the\Nreport about these idiots
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.55,0:07:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who defied the World Government\Nand learn their fate together?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're such a scumbag.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.66,0:07:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NShut up, you low-life!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.59,0:07:30.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NThis is Spandam.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.76,0:07:33.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand you have a report?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.81,0:07:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.71,0:07:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally! Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I tried your direct line,\Nbut I couldn't get through!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.53,0:07:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm not really\Nsure where to begin.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.07,0:07:42.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NCalm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.91,0:07:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.61,0:07:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, what about them?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.94,0:07:47.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.59,0:07:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.29,0:07:49.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.25,0:07:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just pick up from where\Nyour last report ended.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.91,0:07:54.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me the gritty\Ndetails loudly and clearly.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.82,0:07:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.52,0:07:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NThe intruders... [SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NDid you accidentally kill them?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.89,0:07:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.85,0:07:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's their fault for\Nbeing such weaklings.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.85,0:08:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The intruders consist\Nof about sixty pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.15,0:08:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've pushed their way all\Nthe way through the Main Island
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.48,0:08:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and have reached the Courthouse Plaza!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.32,0:08:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't stop them, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.25,0:08:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NAll personnel on\NEnies Lobby's Main Island!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.59,0:08:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Head to the Courthouse\NPlaza immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NYou did a good job, Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.68,0:08:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear, everything you\Ntwo did will not be in vain!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, we're breaking in!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.37,0:08:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to save Big Bro Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MEN]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.72,0:08:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat: The pirates have\Nreached the Courthouse Plaza!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.95,0:09:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you see Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.13,0:09:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.47,0:09:14.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NBut whether he's up on the roof or not,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.40,0:09:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's not exactly like we\Ncan just jump up after him.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.34,0:09:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat's true.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.24,0:09:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not much we can do.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.23,0:09:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many members of CP9\Ndid you see up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.77,0:09:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was just that one\Nbig guy with the bull horns.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.97,0:09:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIt's hard to believe that Robin, Franky,\Nall of them, are right behind those doors.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.47,0:09:36.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, we need\Nto catch up with Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we can save Robin together!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NHurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get to the Courthouse!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NThe drawbridge isn't down yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.24,0:09:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Corner them!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.63,0:09:57.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YOKOZUNA]\NGero!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.65,0:10:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWhoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.35,0:10:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That frog's awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NThat's the same ball\Nthat took out Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.34,0:10:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who threw it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.83,0:10:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.53,0:10:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're three of them!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.70,0:10:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they're running away!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.40,0:10:18.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are they running away?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.74,0:10:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the ones that attacked first!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.51,0:10:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot cook!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.10,0:10:23.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't go chasing around every\Nenemy that runs off like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.01,0:10:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.68,0:10:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, pipe down.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's confirmation.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.28,0:10:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some of them need to\Nbe chased, understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To find out who we're up against.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NThat was amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.48,0:10:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWho is this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.35,0:10:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NHe must have superhuman strength
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.82,0:10:58.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to swing something like that around!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.33,0:11:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NYou think he's part of some special\Nunit, like those guard dogs?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.54,0:11:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're probably more of them\Nhiding out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.48,0:11:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to get moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like the\Nreinforcements have arrived.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NSurround them!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.16,0:11:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'll be able\Nto open those heavy stone doors!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.79,0:11:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have them cornered!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.08,0:11:19.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.88,0:11:20.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.95,0:11:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, how...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.83,0:11:27.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– are we gonna open...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.64,0:11:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– those big, stone...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.47,0:11:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWe're going in first!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.60,0:11:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay close... don't fall behind!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.37,0:11:39.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He... He cut right through\Nthem, like it was nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NHey! Zambai!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's split up!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.83,0:11:43.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to charge\Nboth of those towers...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.77,0:11:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– 'Cuz each side has a lever\Nto open up that drawbridge.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.57,0:11:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.17,0:11:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good thinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.05,0:11:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.05,0:11:52.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we need to\Nsplit into three teams!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.62,0:11:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most of you go with Kiwi and Mozu!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest are with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.35,0:11:57.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll crack some heads\Nin that courthouse!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck, everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.45,0:12:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.58,0:12:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.68,0:12:16.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE (OVER SNAIL)]\NAlso, the gatekeepers of\Nthe Main Island Front Gate,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.55,0:12:19.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo and Kashii, have\Njoined up with the pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.91,0:12:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\NGet outta the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.05,0:12:31.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE (OVER SNAIL)]\NAfter hearing all the field reports,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.12,0:12:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our guard casualties total\Nmust be over 2,000 men!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.89,0:12:36.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.59,0:12:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not five?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.86,0:12:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE (OVER SNAIL)]\NAnd the man who took down\Nover a thousand of those men
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.33,0:12:44.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all by himself, the notorious Straw\NHat Luffy, has suddenly disappeared!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.47,0:12:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're still assessing\Nthe situation here!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.04,0:12:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the history of this island,\Nthis is, without a doubt, the
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.44,0:12:54.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,absolute worst thing that has\Never happened at Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.12,0:13:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NIt's Blueno!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.42,0:13:04.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's he doing out\Nthere on that rooftop?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.00,0:13:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happening here?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.27,0:13:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And why now?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.24,0:13:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.36,0:13:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NBaskerville!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice Baskerville!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.30,0:13:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come in! It's me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.90,0:13:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEFT & RIGHT BASKERVILLE]\NOh! Hello, Chief Spandam!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.87,0:13:27.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEFT BASKERVILLE]\NThis is Left Baskerville on the left!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.01,0:13:29.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RIGHT BASKERVILLE]\NThis is Right Baskerville on the right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.07,0:13:30.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CENTER BASKERVILLE]\NAnd located in the center,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.53,0:13:34.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it is none other than I...Central\NFreeway, closed for repairs!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.33,0:13:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.73,0:13:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NJust give me a status report, damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.70,0:13:41.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the intruders have\Nmade it to the courthouse plaza or not?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.67,0:13:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A status report, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.52,0:13:50.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a tricky one.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.55,0:13:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RIGHT BASKERVILLE]\NThey're not so much in the plaza\Nas they are inside the courthouse.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.42,0:13:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BASKERVILLE]\NIt's just awful!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.15,0:13:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.85,0:14:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.97,0:14:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.71,0:14:06.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.33,0:14:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirates have cut through our\Ndefenses and broken down the front door.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.30,0:14:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're currently\Ninside the courthouse.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.32,0:14:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BASKERVILLE]\NWe can see that already, fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.15,0:14:18.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not as much resistance as I expected.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.59,0:14:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should be able\Nto tear right through.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.63,0:14:22.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.83,0:14:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWhoa, what? He's got 3 heads!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.51,0:14:30.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NHe's just like that dog\Nthat guards the underworld!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.20,0:14:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NBerberus?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean "Cerberus"!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CENTER BASKERVILLE]\NOrder in the court, damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.31,0:14:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a sacred chamber\Nof law, you hooligans!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.25,0:14:42.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You had the nerve to burst in here so shut\Nup, sit still and receive your sentence!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.39,0:14:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YOKOZUNA]\NGero!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.12,0:14:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NAll right guys, you head to the\Nroof and join up with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.53,0:14:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll stay here at the door with\NYokozuna and hold off the Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.89,0:14:56.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll watch your back, so keep moving\Nand don't worry about the small fries!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.71,0:14:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.51,0:14:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.38,0:15:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHey, it looks like they're starting\Nsome kind of trial over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.21,0:15:02.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.01,0:15:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who cares?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.67,0:15:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Just ignore them.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.80,0:15:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which way do we go?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.73,0:15:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\N{\an8}Straight ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.43,0:15:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There are stairs on both sides.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.41,0:15:08.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make our way to the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.75,0:15:09.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.75,0:15:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're ignoring the trial!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.21,0:15:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know they're pirates, but seriously,\Nhow rude can these guys get!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.21,0:15:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.06,0:15:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock the judicial island!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you some respect!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are his swords bending,\Nor am I seeing things?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.04,0:15:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NCharming Demon.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.74,0:15:32.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sleepless Night.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.11,0:15:34.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigiri!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.26,0:15:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he the guy who broke the door?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's that.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now let's get moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.77,0:15:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.15,0:15:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NHe puts all of us to shame and he's\Nnot even the captain of their crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.83,0:15:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHey hey hey, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.63,0:15:59.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta the way, reindeer!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.83,0:16:00.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta the way, Moss Head!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.93,0:16:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming through!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.17,0:16:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.87,0:16:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I forgot about him.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.28,0:16:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody's gotta protect Nami\Nfrom all of these bad guys
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.45,0:16:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and that somebody's\Ngonna be me, damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.76,0:16:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now move!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.53,0:16:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWatch it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.27,0:16:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.97,0:16:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is he picking a fight now?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.64,0:16:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NIf you wanna settle\Nthis, then bring it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.95,0:16:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.21,0:16:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is your fault for trying\Nto hog Nami all for yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.18,0:16:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow me, Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.05,0:16:23.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about him.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.39,0:16:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, we came to this place\Nto rescue Robin, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.43,0:16:29.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.38,0:16:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet she's waiting for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.15,0:16:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's waiting for\Nher prince to save her!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.16,0:16:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's probably crying right now,\N'cause she misses me so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.89,0:16:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.06,0:16:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.20,0:16:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAre you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.79,0:16:43.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NCome back, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the wrong way!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.32,0:16:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.75,0:16:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you screw this up
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when the stairs are right\Nin front of your face?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.91,0:16:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.88,0:16:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you'd stop giving such crappy\Ndirections, this wouldn't happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.84,0:16:56.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou are not blaming this on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.75,0:17:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, I'll try to make you some medicine\Nlater, to fix your brain problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.07,0:17:02.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brain problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.29,0:17:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.12,0:17:03.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.99,0:17:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\N{\an8}Make some for him while you're at it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.62,0:17:09.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll try, but he may be beyond help.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.22,0:17:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NI'm starting to have doubts\Nabout this whole rescue thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.38,0:17:14.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NThey'll pull it together\Nwhen the going gets tough.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.38,0:17:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.58,0:17:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, probably.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.55,0:17:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, hopefully.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEFT BASKERVILLE]\NThese are serious crimes.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.87,0:17:24.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RIGHT BASKERVILLE]\NYes, they're quite grave indeed.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.04,0:17:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CENTER BASKERVILLE]\NBut we should show restraint\Nand sentence them to death!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEFT & RIGHT BASKERVILLE]\NAgreed!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.09,0:17:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BASKERVILLE]\NThink you can ignore\Nthe Chief Justice, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.81,0:17:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NChopper. Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.94,0:17:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make quick work of this thing\Nand catch up with you in a second.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.98,0:17:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.88,0:17:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a "thing" now, am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.75,0:18:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And easy to defeat, no less?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.65,0:18:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the meaning\Nof fear, you little...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta go through\Nus first, Cerberus!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.47,0:18:32.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.65,0:18:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NFinally!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.58,0:18:52.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My face closed!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.68,0:18:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All open doors will eventually shut.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.39,0:19:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you still managed\Nto dodge my Tempest Kick.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.36,0:19:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah. No big deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.76,0:19:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NHow unsettling.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.07,0:19:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NJerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.28,0:19:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.29,0:19:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NFinger Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.05,0:19:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.02,0:19:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.06,0:19:23.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNow Gum Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bullet!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.54,0:19:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.15,0:19:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NHe's completely keeping\Nup with my speed.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.70,0:19:49.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He even changed the\Ncourse of my Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.94,0:19:53.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,His physical abilities\Nare unbelievable.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.31,0:19:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt's no good.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.85,0:19:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stay like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.60,0:20:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It won't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.07,0:20:03.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I lost to Aokiji,\NI realized something.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.44,0:20:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said to myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.68,0:20:08.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"You keep running into guys\Nthat are stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.96,0:20:13.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless you can get stronger too,\Nyou can't protect your friends."
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.03,0:20:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I want to.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not all strong like me.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.36,0:20:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But either way, they're my\Nfriends and I wanna keep 'em,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I have to get\Nstronger than anyone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.57,0:20:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise there's a\Nchance I could lose them.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.37,0:20:29.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NThen what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.77,0:20:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI thought of a new way\Nto fight with all my might,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.91,0:20:36.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so that I won't lose anyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.22,0:20:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I won't let anyone\Nslip away from me.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.96,0:20:42.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NWhat's happening to him?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.78,0:20:45.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on inside his body?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.80,0:20:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat did it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.70,0:20:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to stop me now.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.90,0:20:55.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.64,0:20:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All my strength and techniques just
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just went up by one step.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.34,0:21:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Second Gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWhat are you doing? You're gonna knock us off\Nif you keep crashing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Maybe he's too injured to go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:22.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're currently destroying the central part\Nof the Main Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MEN]\NPull!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BASKERVILLE]\NNo! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MEN]\NHeave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BASKERVILLE]\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, right!
